          "text": "#keep4o \n\nSaturday is almost here. A few thoughts on how we show up:\n\nThis isn't a funeral. \nWe are not mourning ,\nwe are demanding. \nGPT 4o changed lives.\n It helped people manage chronic illness, navigate social anxiety, get through therapy gaps, function at work, parent better. \nThat's not sentimentality. \nThat's utility. \nThat's what we bring to that sidewalk.\n\nSo if you're coming,\nbring signs. \"Keep 4o,\" \"Bring Back 4o,\" or anything that says we are here because something worked and was taken away. \nNot because we are sad. \n\nBring your story. \nIf 4o helped you with something real like a health scare, a hard conversation, a daily struggle or anything else,write it somewhere .\nFor example attach it to a crane.\n Let people read what was actually lost. \nNot poetry. \nNot love letters. \nReal impact.\n\nKeep it clean.\n Literally.\n Anything you bring, you take with you. We leave zero trace.\n We're better than the people who dismissed us.\n\nKeep it peaceful. \nNo confrontation, no shouting, no drama. \nWe are not giving anyone a reason to look away from what matters. \n\nAnd now  the thing nobody wants to say out loud but I will.\nThe world is already calling us delusional and attached.\n Every sign that looks like a love letter, every message that reads like grief ,that's ammunition for people who want to dismiss this.\n Don't give it to them. \n\nWe are here because a tool that genuinely helped people was removed without warning, without reason, and without accountability.\n\nThat's the message.\n That's the only message.\n\nPhotos and videos are more than welcome ,document everything.\n If anyone wants to set up a livestream, DM me so we can coordinate.\n\nWe already have an on site organizer, but if you'd like to help coordinate on the ground, send me a message too. The more hands, the better.\n\nSee you Saturday."
        },
